  "executedModel": "actual-model-name",
  "agentGate": 3,
  "latencyMs": 1234,
  "verified": true,
  "response": "Actual provider response"
}
```

This JSON is a contract example, not a hardcoded test result.

For an unavailable integration, return an explicit non-success result.

